{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"高空墜物","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"22d1fecdd3f42870ce9414f7ca35e43ae38bbf40c8eb12910dbc080d6ab7cfc1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"企鵝物流的另一名員工——德克薩斯帶來了撤退路線的資訊。\n然而，這股整合運動的表現讓眾人感到不安——他們的首領似乎認識米莎。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，好慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快到截擊地點了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，終於......明明剛打開包裝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"浪費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！後面的，跟緊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的面具人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"一起上吧，我趕時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，企鵝物流的德克薩斯已歸隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"有些新情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我幹掉了不少，那些叫整合運動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——但他們後面，跟著的更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動已經放棄了最開始的偽裝，開始集體行動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然是這樣嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動已經透過貧民區混進龍門......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......目標和我們相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，他們沒理由追擊我們羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎小姐身上，有龍門和整合運動才知道的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"這對羅德島很不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"形勢有點不容樂觀啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"一會兒得去戳戳那個督察的漂亮臉蛋問個明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的話，我來帶路。我很清楚該怎麼走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使已經確定了撤退路線，我帶你們過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，集合各個小隊，我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我們？我們得先找個掩體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動已經到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這邊！別讓他們跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"追在尾巴後面的麻煩是最討厭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——不對——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......有首領！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"當心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨，他們就在這兒——是她沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"術師們，去吧，去把這些人撕得稀碎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"口出狂言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！敵人派出了多個術師，注意對策！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對方的目標是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——米莎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_firstcontact"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"終於......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我終於......找到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
